 value of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 October to November came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far March to April sits at 37%. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 20607 lowest at 61%.</p>"}
